WU1 APPLIES: the first read lays nothing over what it reads
WU2 APPLIES: the first read lays every account's unstored changes
WU3 APPLIES: a change lays every account's unstored changes
WU4 APPLIES: a change keeps and lays only itself
WU5 APPLIES: a change goes under the earlier unstored ones
WU6 APPLIES: a change's own read shows only that change over it
WU7 APPLIES: a change's own read is not shown, only what was shown
WU8 APPLIES: a change to a name the store cannot read does not show
WU9 APPLIES: a change shows only what was read, nothing laid over it
WU10 APPLIES: a write holds only the change, not what was read
WU11 APPLIES: a write folds in what was never stored
WU12 APPLIES: a name the store cannot read is written over, as nothing kept
WU13 APPLIES: a write that fails counts as stored
WU14 APPLIES: a write that fails is not caught
WU15 APPLIES: a change not stored is kept in memory only after an earlier one
WU16 APPLIES: a stored change after an unstored one is not kept in memory
WU17 APPLIES: changes are kept in memory only after two unstored ones
WU18 APPLIES: nothing is kept in memory
WU19 APPLIES: the memory is forgotten when the account changes
WU20 APPLIES: the memory is forgotten when the diary locks or closes
PR1 APPLIES: the store is never read
PR2 APPLIES: setLook keeps nothing
PR3 APPLIES: setOrder keeps nothing
PR4 APPLIES: setIcon keeps nothing
PR5 APPLIES: changes run at once, not one after another
PR6 APPLIES: the account's first read does not wait its turn
PR7 APPLIES: nothing resets when the account changes
PR8 APPLIES: the last account's looks show for a render after the switch
PR9 APPLIES: a late first read lands on the next account
PR10 APPLIES: a late change shows under the next account
PR14 APPLIES: a read that fails is not caught
PR15 APPLIES: setOrder keeps a repeated id
PR16 APPLIES: with no account open a change is kept anyway
PR17 APPLIES: lookOf ignores what was kept
PR18 APPLIES: the kept order is not given
PR19 APPLIES: iconOf ignores what was kept
PR20 APPLIES: icons kept under another name
